{%- comment -%}
  destination-schema — 都市ページのJSON-LD構造化データ(SEO用)。
  パンくずは表示側(destination-hero)に合わせ、地域を挟まず
  TOP → 撮影地一覧 → 都市名 の3階層で統一している。
  Params:
    destination — required, Destination metaobjectの1件
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  早わかり情報(飛行時間/時差/ベストシーズン/おすすめな人)をadditional
  Propertyとして構造化データにも出す。destination-quickfacts.liquidの
  表示(dl/dt/dd)と同じ内容をAI検索・生成AI概要が直接抽出できるようにする
  ため。表示側のUIは変えず、データだけ二重化して出力している。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fact_props = '' -%}
{%- assign fact_count = 0 -%}
{%- if destination.flight_time.value != blank -%}
  {%- if fact_count > 0 -%}{%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture fact_item -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "飛行時間", "value": {{ destination.flight_time.value | json }} }{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: fact_item -%}
  {%- assign fact_count = fact_count | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if destination.time_difference.value != blank -%}
  {%- if fact_count > 0 -%}{%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture fact_item -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "時差", "value": {{ destination.time_difference.value | json }} }{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: fact_item -%}
  {%- assign fact_count = fact_count | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if destination.best_season.value != blank -%}
  {%- if fact_count > 0 -%}{%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture fact_item -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "ベストシーズン", "value": {{ destination.best_season.value | json }} }{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: fact_item -%}
  {%- assign fact_count = fact_count | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if destination.recommended_for.value != blank -%}
  {%- if fact_count > 0 -%}{%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture fact_item -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "おすすめな人", "value": {{ destination.recommended_for.value | json }} }{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign fact_props = fact_props | append: fact_item -%}
  {%- assign fact_count = fact_count | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "TouristAttraction",
  "name": {{ destination.name_ja.value | json }},
  "description": {{ destination.description.value | strip_html | truncate: 300 | json }},
  {%- if destination.hero_image.value %}
  "image": [{{ destination.hero_image.value | image_url: width: 1600 | prepend: "https:" | json }}],
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if destination.country.value != blank %}
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "addressCountry": {{ destination.country.value | json }}
  },
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if fact_count > 0 -%}
  "additionalProperty": [{{ fact_props }}],
  {%- endif -%}
  "url": {{ canonical_url | json }}
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "TOP", "item": {{ shop.url | append: routes.root_url | json }} },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "撮影地一覧", "item": {{ shop.url | append: '/pages/destinations' | json }} },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ destination.name_ja.value | json }}, "item": {{ canonical_url | json }} }
  ]
}
</script>
{%- comment -%}
  faqs：「FAQ Item」metaobjectの各エントリーがdestinationフィールドで
  この都市を指しているものを集める(destination-faq.liquidと同じ
  逆参照方式)。入力されていれば、AI検索・生成AI概要などが質問と
  回答をそのまま抽出しやすいFAQPage構造化データも出力する。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign schema_faq_source = shop.metaobjects.faq_item.values -%}
{%- assign schema_faq_items = '' -%}
{%- assign schema_faq_count = 0 -%}
{%- for item in schema_faq_source -%}
  {%- if item.destination.value.slug.value == destination.slug.value and item.question.value != blank and item.answer.value != blank -%}
    {%- if schema_faq_count > 0 -%}{%- assign schema_faq_items = schema_faq_items | append: ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- capture faq_item -%}{ "@type": "Question", "name": {{ item.question.value | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ item.answer.value | json }} } }{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign schema_faq_items = schema_faq_items | append: faq_item -%}
    {%- assign schema_faq_count = schema_faq_count | plus: 1 -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if schema_faq_count > 0 -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [{{ schema_faq_items }}]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}
